# CODEOWNERS — who must approve a change to each area.
#
# Enforced only when the `main` ruleset has "Require review from Code Owners"
# switched on (see .github/rulesets/main-protection.json).
#
# DESIGN NOTE: intern teams are deliberately NOT listed as owners anywhere.
# A code owner can satisfy the code-owner review requirement, so listing
# @interns-grc as owner of /03-GRC/ would let one GRC intern approve the
# other's work and merge it unreviewed. Every merge to main needs a mentor.
# Peer review is encouraged as a second reviewer, not as the gate.

